//│ ╟── This value is stored in this record field.
//│ ║  l.184: 	fun exportRecord() = {callback: hiddenRecord}
//│ ║         	                      ^^^^^^^^
//│ ╟── This value is returned here.
//│ ║  l.184: 	fun exportRecord() = {callback: hiddenRecord}
//│ ║         	                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
//│ ╟── 'exportRecord' is exposed by this compilation unit.
//│ ║  l.184: 	fun exportRecord() = {callback: hiddenRecord}
//│ ╙──       	^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
